{
  "schema": "phase30.independent.zookeeper-optional-transaction-digest.v1",
  "supersedes": "No old corpus is modified. This adds source-permitted per-record absence under the existing transaction_digest=true supported-feature profile.",
  "sourceCorpusSha256": "20f299fee6edfe344581987c64d7ddd802b3f5521b99daaa4985de78bd87b341",
  "sources": [
    "https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/blob/release-3.9.3/zookeeper-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zookeeper/server/persistence/Util.java",
    "https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/blob/release-3.9.3/zookeeper-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zookeeper/server/Request.java",
    "https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/blob/release-3.9.3/zookeeper-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zookeeper/server/util/SerializeUtils.java",
    "https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/blob/release-3.9.3/zookeeper-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zookeeper/server/PrepRequestProcessor.java"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "When transaction_digest=true, after fully decoding the selected canonical operation, remaining0bytes means absent digest; exactly12bytes means a complete version2digest. This flag enables support, not mandatory presence on every row.",
    "Remaining1..11or>12reject under this deliberately strict selected reader profile. Pinned upstream tolerates EOF while attempting digest parsing, including a partial suffix; this corpus does not grant that permissive partial encoding.",
    "transaction_digest=false accepts no digest suffix; a complete suffix still rejects as trailing bytes under that explicit profile.",
    "Snapshot digest/last-zxid seals remain explicit existing flags and are not changed. Missing transaction digest is not permission to skip operation fields, framing, checksum, zxid ordering or available digest checks.",
    "Replay may compute state through a digest-free transaction, but must verify every present digest. No complete-current/history/committed endpoint premise follows from raw parser acceptance."
  ],
